Package: ngvb2
Type: Package
Title: Latent Non-Gaussian Models via INLA and Variational Bayes (v2)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Rafael", "Cabral", email = "rafael.medeiros.cabral@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Rebuild of the 'ngvb' package. Checks the latent Gaussian assumption
    (ng.check) and fits latent non-Gaussian models (ngvb) on top of R-INLA using a
    variational Bayes algorithm. A single unified rgeneric/cgeneric engine implements the
    conditional precision Q(theta, V) = D(theta)^T diag(1/V) D(theta) and owns the
    V-dependent normalizing constant, and a model registry covers iid, rw1, rw2, ar1,
    ar(p), Ornstein-Uhlenbeck, CAR/besag, SAR and SPDE/Matern models.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
